{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36613","headline":"早春巴陵道中 · 罗隐","name":"早春巴陵道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远雪亭亭望未销，岳阳春浅似相饶。\n短芦冒土初生笋，高柳偷风已弄条。\n波泛洞庭㺍獭健，谷连荆楚鬼神妖。\n中流菱唱泊何处，一只画船兰作桡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}